            "id": "comment-intro",
            "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
            "data": {
              "comment": "# 🖼️ Product Mockup Generator\n\nOne product photo in, a coordinated set of lifestyle mockups out. Use it when you need several distinct scenes for one product instead of one prompt and one image.\n\n**How it works:** \"1️⃣ Product name\", \"5️⃣ Product description\", \"4️⃣ Target audience\" and \"2️⃣ Scene count\" (6) fill \"6️⃣ Build scene prompt\". \"7️⃣ Scene concept agent\" invents distinct scenes, and \"8️⃣ Build image prompt\" turns them into photography prompts. \"9️⃣ Split into per-scene prompts\" emits one prompt per scene to two branches. \"🔟 Render scene (text-to-image)\" draws the empty scene for the \"scene\" output. \"🅰️ Composite product into scene (image-to-image)\" places \"3️⃣ Product image\" into the scene at strength 0.65. Two Brightness/Contrast passes, \"🅱️ Brightness / contrast polish\" and \"©️ Final color adjust → mockup\" (contrast 1.1), finish the \"mockup\" output. Pick models on \"7️⃣ Scene concept agent\" and \"9️⃣ Split into per-scene prompts\".\n\n**Try this:** Change \"4️⃣ Target audience\" to \"college students on a budget\" and watch the whole shot list shift."
            },
